SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7.0 charge
    pe 4
    redox pe
    units mol/kgw
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)   -0.7  10
    Pyrite  0.0   0.1
    Goethite 0.0  0
    Gypsum   0.0  0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -molalities Fe+3 Fe+3OH Fe+3(OH)2 Fe+3(OH)3- Fe+3(OH)4- Fe+3Cl+ FeCl+2 FeCl+3 FeCl2+ FeCl3(aq)
END
